    <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-4 leading-tight text-balance">
        How to Convert Several Screenshots Fast Without Batch Software
    </h1>

    <AuthorByline publishDate="2026-08-22" />

    <figure class="my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft">
